= The League of Five Provinces

Sun Chuanfang, Zhili general and protege of Wu Peifu, the "Jade Marshal", has solidified his control, basing his rule in Nanjing.

Using his power, he has formed the "League of Five Provinces", Jiangsu, Fujian, Jiangxi, Anhui and Zhejiang.

The rift between Wu Peifu and Sun Chuanfang has begun expanding, seeming as he isn't intervening much with Wu's diplomacy and the Anti-Fengtian war.

Supposedly, their alliance may just be in name only. We see this as an opportunity. If we avoid provoking Sun Chuanfang, we can defeat each Beiyang warlord one-by-one.

- @done: Can the league hold?

